    "body": "Closes #8026\r\n\r\nIt looks like Android does some silly version-specific partial implementation of complex numbers. I don't think we want to spend too much time working round Android bugs (especially since we aren't really in a position to test it) but this one is fairly easy.\r\n\r\nI've also refactored the check to be a little more verbose but hopefully easier to read.",
    "closed_at": "2026-10-11T17:47:10Z",
    "comment_data": [
        {
            "_links": {
                "html": {
                    "href": "https://github.com/cython/cython/pull/8031#discussion_r4172826932"
